  "construction_notes": [
    {
      "text": "The developer of the 80 townhomes designs and entitles this rental building, then dedicates its 1.456-acre parcel to the City in place of the 36 inclusionary units the townhomes and apartments would otherwise owe. The City then issues a competitive request for proposals for a nonprofit developer to build and manage it.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001984"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The townhomes are a separate record: SCC-000074.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001984"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Legistar PC item 25-0513 (April 28, 2025): 5.24-acre site, 80 townhomes, 162 apartments and 2,050 sq ft commercial; tentative map for 31 lots and 80 condominiums; zoning ECR-MU54; CEQA 15183 via El Camino Real Specific Plan EIR.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001513"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "SF YIMBY: apartment building is a 75-foot podium on the triangular parcel; 281 car and 212 bicycle spaces for the project; Vandertoolen Associates prepared the site map.",
